            "block_order": 2
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "d.Check that the interaction equation for in-plane and out-of-plane shear is satisfied (Equation 6-7). Note that $\\mathsf{V}_{\\mathsf{s o}}$ and $\\mathsf{V}_{\\mathsf{s i}}$ are the inplane and out-of-plane shear forces,respectively, resisted by shear reinforcement, which are both equal to zero in this case (i.e. wall has no shear reinforcement).\n",
            "block_bbox": [
                274,
                443,
                1045,
                573
            ],
            "block_id": 3,
            "block_order": 3
        },
        {
            "block_label": "formula",
            "block_content": "\\begin{aligned}&\\left(\\frac{V_{u o}}{V_{m o}+V_{s o}}\\right)^{2}+\\left(\\frac{V_{u i}}{V_{m i}+V_{s i}}\\right)^{2}\\leq1.0\\\\&\\left(\\frac{43}{260+0}\\right)^{2}+\\left(\\frac{74}{144+0}\\right)^{2}=0.29\\leq1.0\\\\ \\end{aligned}",
            "block_bbox": [
                346,
                598,
                728,
                745
            ],
            "block_id": 4,
            "block_order": 4
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "The combined effect of in-plane and out-of-plane shear stress satisfy the interaction formula – OK.\n",
